AuditLog

Model
ModelVersion
DomainAdaptationRun
InferenceTask

SegmentationMask
LesionMeasurement

ClinicalFeedback
ConsultationSession
ConsultationMinutes
ConsultationMember
Report
```

Đây là phần rất phù hợp với PostgreSQL vì có:

- foreign key;
- transaction;
- unique constraint;
- state transition;
- current workflow;
- RBAC;
- sign-off.

