# 4. MinIO thay cho Amazon S3 ở local

## Bucket structure

```text
uda-raw
uda-processed
uda-reports
uda-models
uda-backups
uda-delta
```

Layout:

```text
uda-raw/
  dicom/
    study_id=<study-id>/
      series_id=<series-id>/
        instance-000001.dcm

uda-processed/
  study_id=<study-id>/
    dwi.nii.gz
    adc.nii.gz
    flair.nii.gz

uda-processed/
  study_id=<study-id>/
    inference_id=<inference-id>/
      probability_map.nii.gz
      binary_mask.nii.gz

uda-reports/
  study_id=<study-id>/
    report_version=1/
      signed_report.pdf
      signed_report.dcm

uda-models/
  model_id=<model-id>/
    version=<version>/
      weights.pt
      metadata.json
      checksum.sha256
```

PostgreSQL chỉ lưu:

```text
StorageID
StudyID
SeriesID
FileURL
FileType
FileSize
Checksum
Location
CreatedAt
```

Ví dụ:

```text
s3://uda-processed/study_id=abc123/dwi.nii.gz
```

Khi chạy local, URL sẽ là:

```text
http://minio:9000/uda-processed/study_id=abc123/dwi.nii.gz
```

Sau này chuyển sang AWS S3 chỉ cần đổi:

```env
OBJECT_STORAGE_PROVIDER=s3
OBJECT_STORAGE_ENDPOINT=https://s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com
OBJECT_STORAGE_BUCKET=uda-strokeseg-prod
```

