s3a://uda-delta/gold/
```

Mình khuyên dùng MinIO path vì sau này migrate sang S3 dễ hơn.

## Bronze tables

```text
bronze.study_events
bronze.series_events
bronze.inference_events
bronze.mask_events
bronze.report_events
bronze.consultation_events
bronze.audit_events
bronze.quarantine_events
